      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ عَلَى غِفَّانِهِ</span></b>  <i>He came at the time thereof:</i>
(O, K:) so says Ibn-'Abbád: (O:) or (K) it is
correctly <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِفَّانِهِ</span>, with the unpointed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ع</span> (O, K,)
originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِفَّانِهِ</span>. (O.)

